  "issues": [
    {
      "body": "This issue tracks the work of collecting the `SemanticSignatureElement`s in `emitEntryFunction` as described in [the proposal](https://github.com/llvm/wg-hlsl/blob/main/proposals/0047-semantic-signatures-metadata-schema.md#accumulate-semanticsignatureelements).\n\nAfter collecting the elements it will invoke the packing of the elements and then emit it as metadata using the interfaces from https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/issues/204878 and https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/issues/204889.\n\nAC:\n- [ ] `SemanticSignatureElement`s are collected in `emitEntryFunction` and wired up to emit packed metadata\n- [ ] Codegen LIT tests are to be added to ensure the metadata is correctly linked to the correct `llvm.dx.load.input` and `llvm.dx.store.output` intrinsic calls",
      "number": 57928,
      "title": "[CGHLSL][DirectX] Generate module metadata for input output signature",
      "url": "https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/issues/57928"
    }
  ],
